    {
      "name": "Burrowing Teeth",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "r6f4gUy0BQ8DEoFo",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>If a Boreworm successfully hits its prey with a melee attack, it latches on and starts to burrow into exposed flesh. It can easily burrow through Mundane armor with an AP of 2 or less. Once it burrows, it automatically does 1 point of damage per hour, ignoring armor. It can be removed from a victim by winning an Opposed Strength test within 3 rounds of it burrowing.</p>"
        },
